#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames.rst:9 25ae29e03fd7444e87c3a9d7738c4d23
msgid ""
"This section includes details on tested frames to speed up DIY builds of "
"rovers and boats.  If you are looking for a completely ready-to-use vehicle "
"please see our :ref:`RTF wiki page <common-rtf>`."
msgstr ""
"本节包含已测试机架的详细信息，以加快漫游车和船的 DIY 构建。如果您正在寻找完全即用的车辆，请参阅 :ref:`RTF wiki 页面 "
"<common-rtf>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames.rst:27 ff7b3d92584c4caf8f1b8ebfa5f5f1c2
msgid ""
"If you have a tested vehicle of your own that you would like added to this "
"list, please do a `blog post on ardupilot.org "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/c/blog>`__, `reply to this discussion "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/reference-frames>`__ and/or :ref:`create a "
"wiki page directly <common_wiki_editing_guide>`.  Please include a video, a "
"list of parts, firmware version used and a parameter file."
msgstr ""
"如果您有自己测试过的车辆希望添加到此列表，请在 `ardupilot.org 发布博文 "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/c/blog>`__、`回复该讨论帖 "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/reference-frames>`__ 和/或 :ref:`直接创建 wiki 页面"
" <common_wiki_editing_guide>`。请附上视频、零件清单、使用的固件版本和参数文件。"
